<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύ̄σ-ᾰλος</span></b> , ὁ, a kind
		of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>toad said to puff itself
			up</i> even to bursting, and to have poisonous breath, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dips.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a poisonous
				<i>fish which puffs itself out,</i> prob.<i>Tetrodon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>whale</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσητήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.368
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				9.49
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
